{"title":"2000 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(answer_choices)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (answer choices)</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/d/12dce4c6afe0f6bfff2b31a3d6b566ec68b03393.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 6 + \\frac{1}{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"80\" height=\"38\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/f/0ffcb7409c86e20ce07b02f87cd96ffedf28461d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{y}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"15\" height=\"42\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/a/0daaa4c88f6df1ae55a7b6bb3134b991ba43cfc4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ \\frac{6}{37} \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ \\frac{37}{6} \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ \\frac67 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ \\frac76 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"422\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Converting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> into a improper fraction, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/2/b62772e7956f2ab0b8f30a977f34f38fe40535c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 6 + \\frac{1}{6} = \\frac{6 \\times 6}{6} + \\frac{1}{6} = \\frac{36}{6} + \\frac{1}{6} = \\frac{37}{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"312\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>The reciprocal of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> is then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/4/4a4da5b4ac611c50bc73bb29b50d7a28e47e7d37.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{y} = \\boxed {\\textbf {(A) } \\frac{6}{37}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"109\" height=\"49\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/b/61b11923a895d0b7ecb5efc0c75a6b0afe6a6dc9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{y} = \\frac{1}{6 + \\frac{1}{6}} = \\frac{1 \\times 6}{(6 + \\frac{1}{6}) \\times 6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"201\" height=\"45\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/d/02dd126bbb22ae6aec2506e55c70de4e036e0db3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{6}{36 + 1} = \\boxed {\\textbf {(A) } \\frac{6}{37}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"168\" height=\"49\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28answer_choices.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(answer_choices)\">Solution 3 (answer choices)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (answer choices)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> is approximately <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Since it is higher than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/f/0ffcb7409c86e20ce07b02f87cd96ffedf28461d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{y}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"15\" height=\"42\" /> must be less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/e/68e911c24cd9526d4670f7100c09bc609a1caad2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{6} = \\frac{6}{36}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"61\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>The only answer choice where this is true is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/c/64c398a32684468eaeb4435e6da5356c9aaee2fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed {\\textbf {(A) } \\frac{6}{37}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"71\" height=\"49\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Pascal\" title=\"2000 CEMC Pascal\">2000 CEMC Pascal</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Pascal_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2000 CEMC Pascal Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Pascal_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2000 CEMC Pascal Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2000 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2000 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2000 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2000 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Pascal_Proble